<p>Rasane zulm me nanhi si kalaai hogi<br />
mujrai kaise sakina ko kal aai hogi</p>

<p>naujawaa'n ne jo sinaa'n seene pa khaai hogi<br />
mujrai qaime se zainab nikal aai hogi</p>

<p>shabe aashoor ye aati thi sadaae zahra<br />
sub'ha ko mere bhare ghar ki safaai hogi</p>

<p>bibiyaa'n kehti thi ye raat ghaneemat jaano<br />
kal to ek jaan pe laakho'n ki chadhaai hogi</p>

<p>naatawaa'n dekh ke abid ko ye bole rehgeer<br />
haaye kisne ise zanjeer pinhaayi hogi<br />
</p>